  {"id": "M7.FRAC.MUL.Q04", "conceptId": "M7.FRAC.MUL", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 2,
   "stem": {"en": "4/9 × 3/8 in its simplest form is", "te": "4/9 × 3/8 కనిష్ఠ రూపంలో"},
   "options": [
     {"id": "a", "text": {"en": "12/72", "te": "12/72"}, "isCorrect": false},
     {"id": "b", "text": {"en": "7/17", "te": "7/17"}, "isCorrect": false, "misconceptionCode": "F-ADD-DENOM"},
     {"id": "c", "text": {"en": "1/6", "te": "1/6"}, "isCorrect": true},
     {"id": "d", "text": {"en": "1/3", "te": "1/3"}, "isCorrect": false}],
   "solution": {"en": "Cancel 4 with 8 (leaving 1 and 2) and 3 with 9 (leaving 1 and 3): 1/3 × 1/2 = 1/6. 12/72 is equal but not simplest.", "te": "4, 8 లను (1, 2 మిగులుతాయి), 3, 9 లను (1, 3 మిగులుతాయి) కొట్టివేయి: 1/3 × 1/2 = 1/6. 12/72 సమానమే కానీ కనిష్ఠ రూపం కాదు."},
   "boardTags": ["NCERT", "TS_SCERT"], "reviewStatus": "draft"},
  {"id": "M7.FRAC.MUL.Q05", "conceptId": "M7.FRAC.MUL", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 3,
